                            ╔═ pause ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗                            
                            ║ ⚠ Pause 2 stacks?                                            ║                            
                            ║                                                              ║                            
                            ║ The maintenance window starts no run of the stack until you  ║                            
                            ║ unpause it. Manual runs are not affected.                    ║                            
                            ║ demo-stack                                                   ║                            
                            ║ mail-relay                                                   ║                            
                            ║ $ sudo qhost stack pause --output json -- demo-stack         ║                            
                            ║ $ sudo qhost stack pause --output json -- mail-relay         ║                            
                            ║                                                              ║                            
                            ║ [ yes, with sudo ]  [ enter cancel ]                         ║                            
                            ║ y yes, with sudo  n/esc/enter cancel                         ║                            
